.TH TESSERA-CONTROLLER-START 8 "" "Tessera" "System administration"
.SH NAME
tessera-controller-start \- Tessera system helper
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
tessera-controller-start [DEVICE]
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Start the packaged compatibility runtime for the named logical device (default main), using the daemon configuration and persistent identity. Intended for the packaged systemd unit.
Wait in the launcher until the daemon has persisted its identity; never generate a substitute identity or restart repeatedly because the first state file is absent.
.SH SEE ALSO
tesserad(8), tesseractl(1)
